{"id":"421908250","kind":"article","title":"常青笔记的标题就像 API","author":"Andy Matuschak","original_authors":["Andy Matuschak"],"original_source_urls":["https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z3XP5GRmd9z1D2qCE7pxUvbeSVeQuMiqz9x1C"],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"常青笔记 & 知识工作","date":"2021-10-15","updated":"2022-09-06","votes":23,"comment_count":5,"minutes":1,"chars":669,"keywords":["常青笔记","笔记标题","原子化笔记","知识管理","概念链接"],"summary":"文章把常青笔记标题比作 API：合理拆分并准确命名后，标题就能成为概念的简洁入口，便于引用、链接和组合。作者建议笔记保持原子性、标题具体明确，并正面陈述主张，以形成更易调用、逐步扩展的知识系统。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/421908250","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"参考文献"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"链接至本文（已汉化）"},{"id":"sec-3","level":2,"title":"声明"}],"html":"<blockquote data-pid=\"E3z-9UiV\">译者注：文中的 API 指的是 Application Programming Interface，即应用程序接口。</blockquote><p data-pid=\"EvGGMvNO\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z4SDCZQeRo4xFEQ8H4qrSqd68ucpgE6LU155C\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">常青笔记</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>划分合理，命名恰当的话，得到的标题就是对笔记内容的抽象。由此一来，整篇笔记讨论的概念可以用这个抓手来引用（见<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z5vA4vw86DKNq22xt6pRWhumeRmSzwV6hxRHE\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">概念抓手，由 Alexander 提出</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>）。实际上，标题寥寥数语便能勾勒出笔记内容轮廓：每天都在笔记中构筑概念并改进笔记的「API」，将大量笔记提炼抽象为单则笔记的能力，也会更上一层楼（例如，<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z6oXuXLZ7Wq1eBqskyfph2wz9gjohQUKSBFzx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情景体验成为大众媒体时蕴藏极大潜力</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup>，<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z3SjnvsB5aR2ddsycyXofbYR7fCxo7RmKW2be\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">常青笔记写作是知识工作的基本单位</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-4\"><a href=\"#ref-4\">[4]</a></sup>）。</p><p data-pid=\"3ykGiz_H\">一些有效的笔记「API 设计」技巧：关注点分离（<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z4Rrmh17vMBbauEGnFPTZSK3UmdsGExLRfZz1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">常青笔记应该是原子化的</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-5\"><a href=\"#ref-5\">[5]</a></sup>），精准标题（<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z3KmNj3oKKSTJfqdfSEBzTQiCVGoC4GfK3rYW\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">笔记标题建议使用完整的句子，避免模糊主张</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-6\"><a href=\"#ref-6\">[6]</a></sup>），和正面阐述（<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z8T6sLNco2benUMgcXUXeJh35eW2obP48DoPp\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">笔记标题建议正面表述，以促进说理系统化</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-7\"><a href=\"#ref-7\">[7]</a></sup>）。</p><p data-pid=\"l4mscaRE\">相关笔记：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z8D1DJ4663xTUx2P3ztA8hM5FsmtbYmgRfPnC\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">有根据的主张，Qian 等人提出</a></p><hr/><h2 id=\"sec-1\">参考文献</h2><p data-pid=\"XEcr5W2m\">与迈克尔·尼尔森的对话，2019-12-16</p><h2 id=\"sec-2\">链接至本文（已汉化）</h2><ul><li data-pid=\"yvwR_1Nc\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"420726986\" href=\"#/post/420726986\">常青笔记应该是原子化的</a></li><li data-pid=\"BqpkML_6\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"421580357\" href=\"#/post/421580357\">常青笔记应面向概念</a></li><li data-pid=\"AYQJBsbZ\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"422262632\" href=\"#/post/422262632\">笔记标题建议使用完整的句子，避免模糊主张</a></li><li data-pid=\"6XS9lbHq\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"436335609\" href=\"#/post/436335609\">常青笔记和 Zettelkasten 卡片系统的异同点</a></li><li data-pid=\"QlRBe6pj\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"418158326\" href=\"#/post/418158326\">概念抓手（来自 Alexander）</a></li><li data-pid=\"3J_uNTjZ\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"542384570\" href=\"#/post/542384570\">笔记类型体系</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-3\">声明</h2><p data-pid=\"s60wX-z4\">此内容发布由 Andy Matuschak 许可。未经允许，不得转载或修改。保留所有权利。</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"00WdRSK7\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z3XP5GRmd9z1D2qCE7pxUvbeSVeQuMiqz9x1C\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Evergreen note titles are like APIs (andymatuschak.org)</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 常青笔记 (Evergreen notes) <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"416319260\" href=\"#/post/416319260\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 概念抓手（来自 Alexander） <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"418158326\" href=\"#/post/418158326\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 情景体验成为大众媒体时蕴藏极大潜力 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"473212636\" href=\"#/post/473212636\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-4\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-4\">↩</a> 常青笔记写作是知识工作的基本单位 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"428784607\" href=\"#/post/428784607\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-5\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-5\">↩</a> 常青笔记应该是原子化的 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"420726986\" href=\"#/post/420726986\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-6\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-6\">↩</a> 笔记标题建议使用完整的句子，避免模糊主张 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"422262632\" href=\"#/post/422262632\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-7\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-7\">↩</a> 笔记标题建议正面表述，以促进说理系统化 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"455603988\" href=\"#/post/455603988\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"421580357","title":"常青笔记应面向概念","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":38,"minutes":5,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 常青笔记 & 知识工作"},{"id":"422262632","title":"笔记标题建议使用完整的句子，避免模糊主张","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":26,"minutes":2,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 常青笔记 & 知识工作"},{"id":"428784607","title":"常青笔记写作是知识工作的基本单位","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":25,"minutes":2,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"436335609","title":"常青笔记和卡片盒笔记法的异同点","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":37,"minutes":3,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"420726986","title":"常青笔记应该是原子化的","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":19,"minutes":2,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[],"rec_answers":[{"id":"2772990761","title":"如何构建自己的笔记系统？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":755,"minutes":20,"reason":"核心节选引用 · 755 赞同","evidence":"目标仅作为 Andy 笔记系统中关于标题的目标标题链接出现，未见对应文章论点的额外表述。"},{"id":"2446781501","title":"你是如何使用双链笔记软件做笔记的？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":46,"minutes":6,"reason":"核心节选引用 · 46 赞同","evidence":"正文通过明确的题名锚点“【翻译】常青笔记的标题就像 API”链接到该译文；目标摘要与回答中笔记实践讨论相符。"}]}